<https://w3id.org/def/ProvKOS> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/def/ProvKOS> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core> .
<https://w3id.org/def/ProvKOS> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov-o-20130430> .
<https://w3id.org/def/ProvKOS> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Inkyung Choi" .
<https://w3id.org/def/ProvKOS> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Jessica Yi-Yun Cheng" .
<https://w3id.org/def/ProvKOS> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "ProvKOS: An Application Profile for Documenting Provenance in Knowledge Organization Systems"@en .
<https://w3id.org/def/ProvKOS> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "ProvKOS extends SKOS and PROV-O to represent the provenance of editorial activities in Knowledge Organization Systems (KOS): typed change activities, warrant structures, and the relationships among entities, activities, agents, and warrants. Revised in response to peer review (2026): class renamed to ProvKOS:ClassNumber; domain of ProvKOS:hasLabel broadened to prov:Entity; explicit PROV-O sub-property alignments; example individuals moved to separate data files."@en .
<https://w3id.org/def/ProvKOS> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.1" .
